---

The dataset in src/data/conflict.json and research/ is a stylised reconstruction
compiled from public open sources (see research/SOURCES.md) for educational
visualisation. It depicts real and tragic historical events; treat figures and
boundaries as approximate, source-cited estimates rather than authoritative
record.
